singleton`. -/\n@[elab_as_elim]\nprotected def recOnSubsingleton [∀ a, Subsingleton (C (mk a))] (q : Trunc α) (f : ∀ a, C (mk a)) :\n    C q :=\n  Trunc.rec f (fun _ b ↦ Subsingleton.elim _ (f b)) q","start":540,"end":544},"axioms":["Quot.sound"]}